flowchart TB
    U[Employees and administrators]
    UI["React portal · Vite · Tailwind<br/>Chat, documents, repositories, tickets, dashboard, admin<br/>localhost:3000"]
    SHARE["Optional remote access<br/>Cloudflare HTTPS tunnel → password-protected gateway :3001"]
    U --> UI
    U -. remote access .-> SHARE
    SHARE -. serves frontend .-> UI

    subgraph BACKEND["Python application · FastAPI / Uvicorn · :8000"]
        API["API routes<br/>JWT authentication · role and repository access checks"]
        CHAT["Chat coordinator<br/>Input safety · conversation context · document / bundle scope"]
        QU["Query understanding<br/>Normalize · PII scrub · intent / entities<br/>Repository routing · filters · expansion · decomposition"]
        RET["Hybrid retrieval<br/>BGE query embeddings · conditional HyDE<br/>Internal-first search with full-corpus fallback<br/>Dense content + question + summary + BM25"]
        RANK["Ranking and context<br/>Reciprocal Rank Fusion → cross-encoder reranking<br/>Priority · freshness · feedback boosts · context budget"]
        ANSWER["Answer service<br/>Grounded generation · citations · confidence<br/>Output safety and citation policy"]
        AGENT["Optional ReAct agent<br/>Document search · ticket lookup · summarizer"]
        ING["Background ingestion jobs<br/>PDF / DOCX / PPTX parsing · classification<br/>Chunking · PII hashing · LLM enrichment<br/>Embedded images: OCR / vision captions"]
        EMB["Embedding service<br/>BGE-small-en-v1.5 · 384 dimensions"]
        BM["In-memory BM25 index"]
        TICKET["Ticket intelligence<br/>CSV import · exact / SQL / semantic lookup<br/>Known issues and resolution mining"]
        OPS["Application services<br/>Repositories · bundles · chat history · access requests<br/>Analytics · evaluation · feedback · knowledge gaps"]
        API --> CHAT --> QU --> RET --> RANK --> ANSWER
        API --> AGENT
        AGENT --> RET
        AGENT --> TICKET
        API --> ING --> EMB
        API --> TICKET
        API --> OPS
        RET --> EMB
        RET --> BM
        ING --> BM
        CHAT --> TICKET
        ANSWER --> OPS
        OPS -. feedback boosts .-> RANK
    end

    UI <-->|"/api proxy · JSON / streaming responses"| API
    SHARE -. forwards API requests .-> API

    subgraph DATA["Local persistence"]
        QD[("Qdrant · :6333<br/>enterprise_knowledge<br/>content / summary / question / keyword vectors<br/>Chunk payloads and access metadata")]
        PG[("PostgreSQL · local :55432<br/>Users / roles · documents · tickets · bundles<br/>Sessions · analytics · feedback · audit records")]
        REDIS[("Redis · :6379<br/>BM25 corpus persistence<br/>Embedding cache")]
        FILES[("Filesystem<br/>Original uploads · extracted images")]
    end

    EMB -->|ingestion vectors| QD
    RET <-->|vector search with access filters| QD
    BM <-->|save / restore corpus| REDIS
    EMB <-->|cache| REDIS
    ING -->|metadata and PII audit records| PG
    ING --> FILES
    TICKET <--> PG
    TICKET -->|semantic search| QD
    OPS <--> PG
    API <-->|authentication and access data| PG
    API -->|authorized source downloads| FILES

    OLLAMA["Local Ollama · local :11435<br/>Answer generation · HyDE · enrichment<br/>Intent classification · optional vision"]
    OR["Optional OpenRouter API<br/>Selected free answer model<br/>Requires server configuration"]
    ANSWER --> OLLAMA
    ANSWER -. selected provider .-> OR
    QU --> OLLAMA
    RET -->|HyDE| OLLAMA
    ING --> OLLAMA
    AGENT --> OLLAMA
    ANSWER -->|answer, sources, confidence and trace| UI

    classDef client fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e
    classDef service fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
    classDef store fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#10b981,color:#064e3b
    classDef model fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
    class U,UI,SHARE client
    class API,CHAT,QU,RET,RANK,ANSWER,AGENT,ING,EMB,BM,TICKET,OPS service
    class QD,PG,REDIS,FILES store
    class OLLAMA,OR model
